          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " baby blanket is 75 x 90 cm. Each V is built from a two-treble cluster on each side instead of a single treble. The result is wider and more pronounced than a standard V-stitch."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DK cotton in a smooth pale colour shows the V structure clearly. Each cluster-V is about 2 cm wide. Total yardage is around 320 g."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
