        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "How to work one cluster-V"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In the same stitch or space: work 2 tr joined at the top (cluster left leg). Ch 1. Work 2 tr joined at the top (cluster right leg). One cluster-V made."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Gauge"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "6 cluster-Vs x 7 rows = 10 x 10 cm in DK cotton with a 4 mm hook. Foundation chain must be a multiple of 5 plus 3 edge chains."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stitches used"
          }
        ]
      },
